@startuml
hide footbox
autonumber
title To create a library (Main)

actor User
participant ":UI" as UI
participant ":LibraryRESTController" as Ctrl
participant ":LibraryService" as Service

User -> UI : I want to create a library.
activate UI
UI --> User : What name?
deactivate UI
User -> UI : libraryName, username
activate UI

UI -> Ctrl : POST /libraries?username={username}\n body: { libraryName }
activate Ctrl

Ctrl -> Service : createAndSave(libraryName, username)
activate Service

ref over Service
[[2_FindUserByUsername.puml Find User by Username]]
end ref

ref over Service
[[3_CheckPolicyAndCreate.puml Check Policy and Create Library]]
end ref

ref over Service
[[4_SaveLibrary.puml Save Library]]
end ref

Service --> Ctrl : library
deactivate Service

ref over Ctrl
[[5_BuildResponse.puml Build Response]]
end ref

Ctrl --> UI : 201 Created\n body: ResponseLibraryDTO
deactivate Ctrl

UI --> User : Your library was created
deactivate UI

@enduml